{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-7","storyName":"为什么全是死脑筋？","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在雷光虫的指引下，宝巫迦一行人穿过地下竹林。然而，前代陛下留下的回响却导致宝巫迦选择独自行动，梓兰等人紧追其后......","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["宝巫迦","梓兰","空爆","政宗","义经","“雷之主”"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"此处再不可贸然前进。","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“雷之主”的踪迹在这里消失了，看来这里便是它的寄居之地。","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"就在这片......竹林？不过为什么地下也有竹林？难道这片竹林和地上那片竹林是连在一起的？！","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不，这片竹林是“雷之主”的杰作。","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"看到飘起的雾气了吗？那是“诅咒”的气息，虽然并非是“诅咒”本身。","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"曾经也有人见证过它们出现在山峦之间，在里面迷失方向的人也不在少数。","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这证明吾等离它不远了。","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我去看看。","id":24},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_xiangchong","volume":"1","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆！","id":30},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-40,0","duration":"0.6","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"咦？！","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你为什么会从我背后——","id":37},{"type":"charslot","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"切不可轻举妄动。","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是“雷之主”的栖息，让这里变成了这样。","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"看来比十年前更加茂密了喵......","id":44},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","volume":"0.8","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（略带迟疑的低吼）","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"雷狼龙是喜欢栖息在溪流地带的怪物，它凭借本能将这里变成了它的巢穴喵。","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"十年前，前代陛下曾无数次地在这片竹林中穿梭喵。","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这片竹林太过诡异，以至于远征队的无数人迷失在其中再也没有回来喵。","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"charslot","id":57},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":58},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":61},{"type":"subtitle","text":"那天，陛下再一次和我们踏入了竹林中喵。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":62},{"type":"subtitle","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":65},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":67},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":69},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"subtitle","text":"在某一刻，竹林的雾气突然散去，缠绕在竹子之间的诡异气息也一扫而空，道路忽然出现在了我们面前喵。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":71},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我以为这是“御轮”终于听到了我的祈祷，为我指引方向喵，然而，当我跑到道路的尽头，却只看到——","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":72},{"type":"subtitle","text":"一头嗜血的巨兽和一缕正在消散的黑色烟云喵。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":73},{"type":"subtitle","id":74},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"charslot","id":78},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":79},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"......咦？","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"怎么了，空爆小姐？","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"宝巫迦，你是不是在发光啊？","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"欸？","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"确实，陛下的身体在发光喵！","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这是——","id":95},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦从怀中取出一个小瓶子。","id":97},{"type":"text","text":"瓶子中，一只飞虫正在撞击着瓶子，它的尾部微微发光。","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这是......","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这是雷光虫喵！","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"雷光虫？","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"雷光虫是一种和雷狼龙共生的虫子喵。","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这是母亲留给吾最后的东西。","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这些年来，吾一直将这只虫子带在身边，对吾来说，看到它，就像母亲还在吾的身边一样。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"但是，这些年来，它都很安静，而且几乎没有发光过，为什么——","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"它好像想出来的样子，要不然放出来看看？","id":114},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦点了点头，打开盖子，雷光虫悠然地从瓶中飞了出来，然后，它缓慢地向竹林深处飞去——","id":116},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":118},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"dialog","id":121},{"type":"charslot","id":122},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":124},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":125,"musicid":1},{"type":"image","image":"71_i05","fadetime":"0","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","id":126},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-80","duration":"0","block":"false","id":127},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"80","xTo":"-150","duration":"50","block":"false","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"幽深的竹海仿佛被悄然唤醒，同样的光点陆续自地面、枝杈、残叶后浮现，星星点点，忽明忽灭，如同雨夜里被风拂动的灯笼。","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"竹林本来的暗影被这层微光洗淡。风吹时，竹叶摇曳投下的影子在地面轻轻浮动，仿佛青色涟漪中漂泊的剪纸。","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦停步，微微抬手。一只雷光虫掠过指尖，带着一簇更亮的电辉盘旋上升。","id":133},{"type":"text","text":"点点光华自上而下洒落，像是一阵由光组成的雨。","id":134},{"type":"text","text":"其他人站在她身侧，也不由自主屏住呼吸——仿佛只要有一丝声响便会惊散这场青光织成的静谧梦境。","id":135},{"type":"text","text":"在这片微光萦绕的竹海里，时间像被青竹握住了脉搏，只留下无声的跳动。","id":136},{"type":"text","text":"而雷光虫的舞蹈，则在跳动之上轻轻铺开一层柔软的、不可言说的安宁。","id":137},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"image","image":"71_i05","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","fadetime":"1.5","id":139},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-200","duration":"0","block":"false","id":140},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-280","duration":"0","block":"false","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"好美。","id":143},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"image","image":"71_i05","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","fadetime":"1.5","id":145},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-200","duration":"0","block":"false","id":146},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"280","duration":"0","block":"false","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哈，看我抓几只带回去！","id":149},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"image","image":"71_i05","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"怎么了，宝巫迦？","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"如果它们和“雷之主”共生，它们应当也和“雷之主”一样来自远方异土......但是为什么，它们没有跟在“雷之主”身边呢？","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾不知道......明明这一幕很美，但吾却感觉到很悲伤。","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"image","id":161},{"type":"charslot","id":162},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":168},{"type":"multiline","name":"政宗","text":"雷光虫......","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"multiline","name":"政宗","text":"对了，是雷光虫喵！","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$7","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"义经，你其实也感觉到了吧喵！","id":173},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice3","volume":"0.8","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（认可的低吼）","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"怎么了？","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，快看！","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"看似无序飞舞的雷光虫，不知何时汇聚在了一起，在竹林中形成了一条细长的光带，通往迷雾的深处。","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"政宗大人，这是你说的那条路吗？","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$7","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"没错，没错喵！","id":187},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice2","volume":"0.8","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（兴奋的低吼）","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"原来那不是道路，而是这些雷光虫照亮的通道喵。","id":192},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"subtitle","text":"原来......如此。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":196},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“雷之主”......若非你的强大，吾无从来到......这里......！","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":197},{"type":"subtitle","text":"只可惜......一切......都晚了......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":198},{"type":"subtitle","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"什么声音？！","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这声音......简直就像是竹林本身发出的......","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这是......母亲的声音？！","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"母亲！你在这里吗！","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"告诉吾，究竟发生了什么？！","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"为什么你的力量会在“雷之主”身上，是它杀了你吗？","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦，别冲动！","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":215},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦！！！","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，宝巫迦已经不见了！","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"追！","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"必须快点找到她！这些话......如果这是前代陛下以某种方式留下的遗言......那宝巫迦一定会控制不住自己的！","id":227},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":230},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":234},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mnwtrfll","volume":"1","channel":"5","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":238},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"5","fadetime":"2.5","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这里是——瀑布？","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"地上全是咒鬼的尸体喵！这些......全部都是陛下杀的喵！","id":244},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","volume":"0.8","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（激动的吼叫）","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"她在那里！","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"咒鬼的尸体一路蔓延，而在这条尸体之路的尽头，宝巫迦站在瀑布的边缘，呆呆地看着瀑布的下方。","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“雷之主”......它的力量......正在吞噬吾......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":254},{"type":"subtitle","text":"宝巫迦，吾的爱女......你必须......变得比它更强......把属于吾等的一切......夺回来......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":255},{"type":"subtitle","id":256},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这些话......","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"啧，对现在的宝巫迦来说，这些话只会刺激她！","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1.5","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snarl_1","volume":"1","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.3","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这些咒鬼，来得真是时候！","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦，等等我们——！","id":277},{"type":"charslot","s